 795:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c **** /*
 796:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * Convert the snprintf return value to the number of characters
 797:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * written. The following are the possible cases:
 798:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *
 799:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * 1. The buffer supplied to snprintf is large enough to hold the
 800:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    generated string. The return value in this case is the number
 801:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    of characters actually written, not counting the terminating
 802:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    null character.
 803:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * 2. The buffer supplied to snprintf is NOT large enough to hold
 804:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    the generated string. The return value in this case is the
 805:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    number of characters that would have been written if the
 806:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    buffer had been sufficiently large, not counting the
 807:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    terminating null character.
 808:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * 3. Encoding error. The return value in this case is a negative
 809:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *    number.
 810:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  *
 811:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * From 1 and 2 above ==> Only when the return value is non-negative
 812:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * and less than the supplied buffer length, the string has been
 813:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  * completely written.
 814:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****  */
